                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 8,
                            "last_played": 1474373106
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I won't ask for a refund because I understand that this is an Early Access title but this game really need more work. The graphics are cool, I really appreciate to be able to change the ingame music by pressing left & right on the controller pad, but the road will be long to compete with others Ping Pong titles already availables.\n\nI suggest the author to follow another way by making a fantasy Ping Pong game, with power-ups and different kinds of AI opponents to challenge. Mario & Sonic Table Tennis or Pink Pong are good examples...",
